# welcome-fit-menu-1024x640 (h10-fit): the gear clicked at its zoomed centre
# (987, 31) in a 1024 x 640 window; the menu at natural size under it, inside
# the window. Dark Arctic Ice, reduced motion.
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 987 31
wait 500
shot welcome-fit-menu-1024x640
